WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.993
Meet Chef Marco!

2
00:00:03.443 --> 00:00:05.487
Hello, Marco! What do you do?

3
00:00:05.937 --> 00:00:08.026
I'm a chef. I cook Italian food.

4
00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.391
Where do you live?

5
00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:13.188
I live in Curitiba.

6
00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:15.031
How do you go to work?

7
00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:20.032
I go to work by bike. And I buy vegetables at the market every morning.

8
00:00:22.282 --> 00:00:23.814
What time do you start work?

9
00:00:24.264 --> 00:00:25.658
I start work at ten a.m.

10
00:00:27.908 --> 00:00:29.858
How many people work in your restaurant?

11
00:00:30.308 --> 00:00:31.516
Twelve people.

12
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:33.219
Who do you admire?

13
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:36.224
I admire my grandmother. She cooks very well!

14
00:00:38.474 --> 00:00:39.913
Why do you love your job?

15
00:00:40.363 --> 00:00:41.803
Because I make people happy!

